IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `coa-core`
IMPORT `coa17-helpers`
IMPORT `coa17-part21a-ch1`

-- coa17-tests-part21a-ch1.l4: tests for ss 790B-790CA (coa17-part21a-ch1.l4). Expected values are written by hand from the
-- text of the section named beside each group.

§ `Tests: Part 21A Chapter 1`

-- s 790B(1) applies to companies OTHER THAN (a) voting shares on a UK or EU regulated market, (b) specified descriptions
#ASSERT `s 790B(1) this Part applies to the company` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790B(1) this Part applies to the company` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790B(1) this Part applies to the company` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790B(1) this Part applies to the company` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 790B(5) "voting shares" means shares carrying voting rights; "voting rights" means rights to vote at general meetings
#ASSERT `s 790B(5) the shares are voting shares` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790B(5) the shares are voting shares` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790B(5) the rights are voting rights` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790B(5) the rights are voting rights` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(15) the shares are voting shares` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(15) the shares are voting shares` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- s 790C(2): significant control is an individual who meets one or more of the specified conditions (Schedule 1A: a seam)
#ASSERT `s 790C(2) the person has significant control over the company` TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(2) the person has significant control over the company` TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(2) the person has significant control over the company` TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790C(2) the person has significant control over the company` FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- s 790C(4): registrable and non-registrable individuals. A holding through a legal entity over which the individual has
-- significant control, held as in paragraph 9(1)(b)(i) (the entity is a relevant legal entity) or (ii) (one entity in the chain is).
`s 790C(4) test holding (i) through a relevant legal entity` MEANS `s 790C(4) holding through a legal entity` WITH
    `s 790C(4)(a) significant control over the legal entity (see s 790C(9)(b))` IS JUST TRUE
    `s 790C(4)(a) how the shares or right are held indirectly` IS `s 790C(4)(a)(i) as described in paragraph 9(1)(b)(i) of Schedule 1A`
    `s 790C(4)(a)(i) the legal entity through which the shares or right are held is a relevant legal entity in relation to the company` IS JUST TRUE
    `s 790C(4)(a)(ii) at least one of the legal entities in the chain is a relevant legal entity in relation to the company` IS JUST FALSE

`s 790C(4) test holding (i) through an entity that is not a relevant legal entity` MEANS `s 790C(4) holding through a legal entity` WITH
    `s 790C(4)(a) significant control over the legal entity (see s 790C(9)(b))` IS JUST TRUE
    `s 790C(4)(a) how the shares or right are held indirectly` IS `s 790C(4)(a)(i) as described in paragraph 9(1)(b)(i) of Schedule 1A`
    `s 790C(4)(a)(i) the legal entity through which the shares or right are held is a relevant legal entity in relation to the company` IS JUST FALSE
    `s 790C(4)(a)(ii) at least one of the legal entities in the chain is a relevant legal entity in relation to the company` IS JUST TRUE

`s 790C(4) test holding (ii) through a chain with a relevant legal entity` MEANS `s 790C(4) holding through a legal entity` WITH
    `s 790C(4)(a) significant control over the legal entity (see s 790C(9)(b))` IS JUST TRUE
    `s 790C(4)(a) how the shares or right are held indirectly` IS `s 790C(4)(a)(ii) as described in paragraph 9(1)(b)(ii) of Schedule 1A`
    `s 790C(4)(a)(i) the legal entity through which the shares or right are held is a relevant legal entity in relation to the company` IS JUST FALSE
    `s 790C(4)(a)(ii) at least one of the legal entities in the chain is a relevant legal entity in relation to the company` IS JUST TRUE

`s 790C(4) test holding (ii) through a chain with no relevant legal entity` MEANS `s 790C(4) holding through a legal entity` WITH
    `s 790C(4)(a) significant control over the legal entity (see s 790C(9)(b))` IS JUST TRUE
    `s 790C(4)(a) how the shares or right are held indirectly` IS `s 790C(4)(a)(ii) as described in paragraph 9(1)(b)(ii) of Schedule 1A`
    `s 790C(4)(a)(i) the legal entity through which the shares or right are held is a relevant legal entity in relation to the company` IS JUST TRUE
    `s 790C(4)(a)(ii) at least one of the legal entities in the chain is a relevant legal entity in relation to the company` IS JUST FALSE

`s 790C(4) test holding through an entity the individual does not control` MEANS `s 790C(4) holding through a legal entity` WITH
    `s 790C(4)(a) significant control over the legal entity (see s 790C(9)(b))` IS JUST FALSE
    `s 790C(4)(a) how the shares or right are held indirectly` IS `s 790C(4)(a)(i) as described in paragraph 9(1)(b)(i) of Schedule 1A`
    `s 790C(4)(a)(i) the legal entity through which the shares or right are held is a relevant legal entity in relation to the company` IS JUST TRUE
    `s 790C(4)(a)(ii) at least one of the legal entities in the chain is a relevant legal entity in relation to the company` IS JUST TRUE

`s 790C(4) test holding through an entity whose control is not known` MEANS `s 790C(4) holding through a legal entity` WITH
    `s 790C(4)(a) significant control over the legal entity (see s 790C(9)(b))` IS NOTHING
    `s 790C(4)(a) how the shares or right are held indirectly` IS `s 790C(4)(a)(i) as described in paragraph 9(1)(b)(i) of Schedule 1A`
    `s 790C(4)(a)(i) the legal entity through which the shares or right are held is a relevant legal entity in relation to the company` IS JUST TRUE
    `s 790C(4)(a)(ii) at least one of the legal entities in the chain is a relevant legal entity in relation to the company` IS JUST TRUE

#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(a)(i) and (ii) a relevant legal entity is among the legal entities through which the shares or right are held` `s 790C(4) test holding (i) through a relevant legal entity` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(a)(i) and (ii) a relevant legal entity is among the legal entities through which the shares or right are held` `s 790C(4) test holding (i) through an entity that is not a relevant legal entity` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(a)(i) and (ii) a relevant legal entity is among the legal entities through which the shares or right are held` `s 790C(4) test holding (ii) through a chain with a relevant legal entity` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(a)(i) and (ii) a relevant legal entity is among the legal entities through which the shares or right are held` `s 790C(4) test holding (ii) through a chain with no relevant legal entity` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(a) the holding through a legal entity meets the conditions of non-registration` `s 790C(4) test holding (i) through a relevant legal entity` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(a) the holding through a legal entity meets the conditions of non-registration` `s 790C(4) test holding through an entity the individual does not control` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(a) the holding through a legal entity meets the conditions of non-registration` `s 790C(4) test holding through an entity whose control is not known` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(a) every holding through a legal entity meets the conditions of non-registration` (LIST `s 790C(4) test holding (i) through a relevant legal entity`, `s 790C(4) test holding (ii) through a chain with a relevant legal entity`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(a) every holding through a legal entity meets the conditions of non-registration` (LIST `s 790C(4) test holding (i) through a relevant legal entity`, `s 790C(4) test holding (ii) through a chain with no relevant legal entity`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (a) non-registrable: no interest except through entities each controlled, and (i)/(ii) hold
#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(a) the individual with significant control is non-registrable` FALSE (LIST `s 790C(4) test holding (i) through a relevant legal entity`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(a) the individual with significant control is non-registrable` TRUE (LIST `s 790C(4) test holding (i) through a relevant legal entity`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(a) the individual with significant control is non-registrable` FALSE (LIST `s 790C(4) test holding (i) through an entity that is not a relevant legal entity`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(a) the individual with significant control is non-registrable` FALSE (LIST `s 790C(4) test holding through an entity whose control is not known`) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(a) the individual with significant control is non-registrable` FALSE (EMPTY) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) otherwise registrable
#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(b) the individual with significant control is registrable` TRUE (LIST `s 790C(4) test holding (i) through a relevant legal entity`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(b) the individual with significant control is registrable` FALSE (LIST `s 790C(4) test holding (i) through a relevant legal entity`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(b) the individual with significant control is registrable` FALSE (LIST `s 790C(4) test holding (ii) through a chain with no relevant legal entity`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(4)(b) the individual with significant control is registrable` FALSE (EMPTY) EQUALS NOTHING
-- a "registrable person" is an individual with significant control who is registrable
#ASSERT `s 790C(4) the individual is a registrable person` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(4) the individual is a registrable person` (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(4) the individual is a registrable person` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(4) the individual is a registrable person` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 790C(5) a "legal entity" is a body corporate or a firm that is a legal person under the law by which it is governed
#ASSERT `s 790C(5) the person is a legal entity` (JUST TRUE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(5) the person is a legal entity` (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(5) the person is a legal entity` (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(5) the person is a legal entity` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(5) the person is a legal entity` (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(5) the person is a legal entity` NOTHING FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 790C(7): subject to its own disclosure requirements if (a) this Part applies to it, (aa) an eligible Scottish partnership, (b) voting shares on a UK or EU regulated market, (c) specified in regulations under s 790B, (d) specified by the Secretary of State
#ASSERT `s 790C(7) the legal entity is subject to its own disclosure requirements` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(7) the legal entity is subject to its own disclosure requirements` (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(7) the legal entity is subject to its own disclosure requirements` (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(7) the legal entity is subject to its own disclosure requirements` (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(7) the legal entity is subject to its own disclosure requirements` NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(7) the legal entity is subject to its own disclosure requirements` (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(7) the legal entity is subject to its own disclosure requirements` NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 790C(6): a relevant legal entity would meet the conditions if it were an individual (a), and is subject to its own disclosure requirements (b)
#ASSERT `s 790C(6) the legal entity is a relevant legal entity in relation to the company` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(6) the legal entity is a relevant legal entity in relation to the company` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(6) the legal entity is a relevant legal entity in relation to the company` NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(6) the legal entity is a relevant legal entity in relation to the company` NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 790C(8): the same shape for relevant legal entities
#ASSERT `s 790C(8)(a) the relevant legal entity is non-registrable` FALSE (LIST `s 790C(4) test holding (i) through a relevant legal entity`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(8)(a) the relevant legal entity is non-registrable` TRUE (LIST `s 790C(4) test holding (i) through a relevant legal entity`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(8)(a) the relevant legal entity is non-registrable` FALSE (EMPTY) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790C(8)(b) the relevant legal entity is registrable` (JUST TRUE) FALSE (LIST `s 790C(4) test holding (ii) through a chain with no relevant legal entity`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(8)(b) the relevant legal entity is registrable` (JUST TRUE) FALSE (LIST `s 790C(4) test holding (i) through a relevant legal entity`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(8)(b) the relevant legal entity is registrable` (JUST FALSE) FALSE (LIST `s 790C(4) test holding (ii) through a chain with no relevant legal entity`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790C(8)(b) the relevant legal entity is registrable` (JUST TRUE) FALSE (EMPTY) EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 790C(9): where the questions in (4) and (8) are determined
#ASSERT `s 790C(9) the question is determined` `s 790C(9)(a)(i) whether someone holds an interest in a company` EQUALS `s 790C(9)(a) in accordance with Part 2 of Schedule 1A`
#ASSERT `s 790C(9) the question is determined` `s 790C(9)(a)(ii) whether someone holds that interest through another legal entity` EQUALS `s 790C(9)(a) in accordance with Part 2 of Schedule 1A`
#ASSERT `s 790C(9) the question is determined` `s 790C(9)(b) whether someone has significant control over that other legal entity` EQUALS `s 790C(9)(b) in accordance with subsections (2) and (3) and Part 1 of Schedule 1A, reading references to the company as references to that other entity`
-- s 790C(12): read as an individual: (a) a corporation sole, (b) a government, (c) an international organisation, (d) a local authority; subject to express provision
#ASSERT `s 790C(12) this Part is read and has effect as if the person were an individual` `s 790C(12)(a) a corporation sole` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(12) this Part is read and has effect as if the person were an individual` `s 790C(12)(b) a government or government department of a country or territory or a part of a country or territory` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(12) this Part is read and has effect as if the person were an individual` `s 790C(12)(c) an international organisation whose members include two or more countries or territories (or their governments)` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(12) this Part is read and has effect as if the person were an individual` `s 790C(12)(d) a local authority or local government body in the United Kingdom or elsewhere` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790C(12) this Part is read and has effect as if the person were an individual` `s 790C(12)(a) a corporation sole` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790C(12) this Part is read and has effect as if the person were an individual` `s 790C(12) a legal person of some other kind` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 790CA a company has had confirmation of information if the person has supplied it, whether or not in pursuance of a duty
#ASSERT `s 790CA the company has had confirmation of the information` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790CA the company has had confirmation of the information` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
